This repository (https://github.com/TheMich157/mailflare) is a modified fork of
https://github.com/hieunc229/mailflare. The original LICENSE file and the
copyright notices in the source are kept.

Modifications in this fork:

- The installation is always fully entitled. There is no account seat cap.
- Every feature that upstream gates on a Pro, Team or other paid license is
  enabled without a license key. That includes account management, shared
  mailboxes and mailbox sharing, booking hosts, custom branding, and email
  forwarding.
- The license activation screen, pricing cards, upgrade banner and Paymug
  license-validation requests are removed. The app does not contact a license
  server.
- The `license_settings` table and its migrations are unchanged and unused.
- The app shows a Source code link to https://github.com/TheMich157/mailflare,
  which is the corresponding source for this version (AGPL-3.0 section 13).
- GitHub Actions publishes the self-hosting Docker image to
  ghcr.io/themich157/mailflare.

